":"I thought this was supposed to be a covert operation... Do we really have to fight her?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G11","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"HK416","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr G11","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"With enemy squads everywhere, I don't think we can make a sneaky getaway..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G11","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You two are a bunch of scaredy-cats. Take a leaf out of my book and just have faith in 45."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"UMP9","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You can't rely on me all the time. Trusting each other is our only hope."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Quit saying things that you don't even believe in yourself. Make good use of us so we can all escape."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"White","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ouroboros is dying to chomp us down, so we cannot let her know that we're still alive."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We must first figure out where her command center is before I come up with the next step of the plan."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This will be our final objective of the entire mission so take it seriously."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Is that your way of encouraging us, 45?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP45","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No, it's my way of threatening you."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Get a move on if you want to live ♪"}]}]}]}
